[{"id":"amana-10-63-1","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"povjerovali su","en":"they believed"},{"bs":"povjerovali ste","en":"you (all) believed"},{"bs":"zar vjerujemo?","en":"do we believe?"},{"bs":"da vjeruju","en":"so that they may believe"}],"ref":"10:63","answerWord":"ءَامَنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/3d0c75a97189eb330fab.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who believe and keep their duty (to Allah).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَكَانُوا۟","يَتَّقُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-77-50-3","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"povjerovat će","en":"will they believe"},{"bs":"i povjerovali su","en":"and they believed"},{"bs":"povjerovali ste","en":"you (all) believed"},{"bs":"zaista će povjerovati","en":"surely he/it will believe"}],"ref":"77:50","answerWord":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","answerSound":"audio/b49d6b4f0bbc75d669df.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"In what statement, after this, will they believe?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["فَبِأَىِّ","حَدِيثٍۭ","بَعْدَهُۥ","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-7-121-1","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"povjerovali smo","en":"we believe"},{"bs":"zaista ćemo povjerovati","en":"surely we will believe"},{"bs":"povjerovao je","en":"he/it believed"},{"bs":"zaista će povjerovati","en":"surely he/it will believe"}],"ref":"7:121","answerWord":"ءَامَنَّا","answerSound":"audio/e6f53dd6afcb5f2bdcc3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Crying: We believe in the Lord of the Worlds,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["قَالُوٓا۟","ءَامَنَّا","بِرَبِّ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-2-13-5","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"povjerovao je","en":"he/it believed"},{"bs":"vjeruje","en":"he/it believes"},{"bs":"vjerujete","en":"you (all) believe"},{"bs":"vjeruju","en":"they believe"}],"ref":"2:13","answerWord":"ءَامَنَ","answerSound":"audio/df59735a50dfd2cbc2ed.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when it is said unto them: believe as the people believe, they say: shall we believe as the foolish believe? are not they indeed the foolish? But they know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","قِيلَ","لَهُمْ","ءَامِنُوا۟","كَمَآ","ءَامَنَ","ٱلنَّاسُ","قَالُوٓا۟","أَنُؤْمِنُ","كَمَآ","ءَامَنَ","ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ","أَلَآ","إِنَّهُمْ","هُمُ","ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ","وَلَٰكِن","لَّا","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[5,10],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-69-33-3","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"vjeruje","en":"he/it believes"},{"bs":"vjerujete","en":"you (all) believe"},{"bs":"vjeruju","en":"they believe"},{"bs":"vjerujemo","en":"we believe"}],"ref":"69:33","answerWord":"يُؤْمِنُ","answerSound":"audio/61f394dd019bd190fa04.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! He used not to believe in Allah the Tremendous,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُ","بِٱللَّهِ","ٱلْعَظِيمِ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-2-13-3","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"vjerujte!","en":"(you all) believe!"},{"bs":"da vjeruju","en":"so that they may believe"},{"bs":"vjeruj!","en":"believe!"},{"bs":"povjerovali su","en":"they believed"}],"ref":"2:13","answerWord":"ءَامِنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/1f677d08b36de928fab3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when it is said unto them: believe as the people believe, they say: shall we believe as the foolish believe? are not they indeed the foolish? But they know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","قِيلَ","لَهُمْ","ءَامِنُوا۟","كَمَآ","ءَامَنَ","ٱلنَّاسُ","قَالُوٓا۟","أَنُؤْمِنُ","كَمَآ","ءَامَنَ","ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ","أَلَآ","إِنَّهُمْ","هُمُ","ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ","وَلَٰكِن","لَّا","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-2-55-4","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"vjerujemo","en":"we believe"},{"bs":"i vjerujte!","en":"and (you all) believe!"},{"bs":"pa su povjerovali","en":"so they believed"},{"bs":"povjerovao sam","en":"I believed"}],"ref":"2:55","answerWord":"نُّؤْمِنَ","answerSound":"audio/443a6f062df9cd255b55.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when ye said: O Moses! We will not believe in thee till we see Allah plainly; and even while ye gazed the lightning seized you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قُلْتُمْ","يَٰمُوسَىٰ","لَن","نُّؤْمِنَ","لَكَ","حَتَّىٰ","نَرَى","ٱللَّهَ","جَهْرَةً","فَأَخَذَتْكُمُ","ٱلصَّٰعِقَةُ","وَأَنتُمْ","تَنظُرُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-2-137-4","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"povjerovali ste","en":"you (all) believed"},{"bs":"pa vjerujte","en":"so believe"},{"bs":"zaista ćete povjerovati","en":"surely you (all) will believe"},{"bs":"da vjeruju","en":"so that they may believe"}],"ref":"2:137","answerWord":"ءَامَنتُم","answerSound":"audio/229338eb9a71edf7e313.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if they believe in the like of that which ye believe, then are they rightly guided. But if they turn away, then are they in schism, and Allah will suffice thee (for defence) against them. He is the Hearer, the Knower.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["فَإِنْ","ءَامَنُوا۟","بِمِثْلِ","مَآ","ءَامَنتُم","بِهِۦ","فَقَدِ","ٱهْتَدَوا۟","وَّإِن","تَوَلَّوْا۟","فَإِنَّمَا","هُمْ","فِى","شِقَاقٍ","فَسَيَكْفِيكَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَهُوَ","ٱلسَّمِيعُ","ٱلْعَلِيمُ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-20-127-5","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"vjeruje","en":"he/it believes"},{"bs":"zaista ćete povjerovati","en":"surely you (all) will believe"},{"bs":"i vjeruju","en":"and they believe"},{"bs":"i učinio ih je sigurnim","en":"and he/it made them safe"}],"ref":"20:127","answerWord":"يُؤْمِنۢ","answerSound":"audio/0e8f2d17728e15bbebef.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus do We reward him who is prodigal and believeth not the revelations of his Lord; and verily the doom of the Hereafter will be sterner and more lasting.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","نَجْزِى","مَنْ","أَسْرَفَ","وَلَمْ","يُؤْمِنۢ","بِـَٔايَٰتِ","رَبِّهِۦ","وَلَعَذَابُ","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","أَشَدُّ","وَأَبْقَىٰٓ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-64-8-0","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"pa vjerujte","en":"so believe"},{"bs":"i povjerovali su","en":"and they believed"},{"bs":"i vjeruje","en":"and he/it believes"},{"bs":"povjerovat će","en":"will they believe"}],"ref":"64:8","answerWord":"فَـَٔامِنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/e41b9cc10a6c5dd524c1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So believe in Allah and His messenger and the light which We have revealed. And Allah is Informed of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["فَـَٔامِنُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","وَرَسُولِهِۦ","وَٱلنُّورِ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَنزَلْنَا","وَٱللَّهُ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ","خَبِيرٌ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-4-59-20","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"vjerujete","en":"you (all) believe"},{"bs":"povjerovali su","en":"they believed"},{"bs":"da vjeruju","en":"so that they may believe"},{"bs":"vjeruje","en":"he/it believes"}],"ref":"4:59","answerWord":"تُؤْمِنُونَ","answerSound":"audio/4bdd3523a4ea4d33bb89.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Obey Allah, and obey the messenger and those of you who are in authority; and if ye have a dispute concerning any matter, refer it to Allah and the messenger if ye are (in truth) believers in Allah and the Last Day. That is better and more seemly in the end.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","أَطِيعُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَأَطِيعُوا۟","ٱلرَّسُولَ","وَأُو۟لِى","ٱلْأَمْرِ","مِنكُمْ","فَإِن","تَنَٰزَعْتُمْ","فِى","شَىْءٍ","فَرُدُّوهُ","إِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱلرَّسُولِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","تُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْءَاخِرِ","ذَٰلِكَ","خَيْرٌ","وَأَحْسَنُ","تَأْوِيلًا"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-19-60-3","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"i povjerovao je","en":"and he/it believed"},{"bs":"pa je povjerovala","en":"so she/it believed"},{"bs":"vjeruju","en":"they believe"},{"bs":"i povjerovali su","en":"and they believed"}],"ref":"19:60","answerWord":"وَءَامَنَ","answerSound":"audio/abf2a18ff50f22384757.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Save him who shall repent and believe and do right. Such will enter the Garden, and they will not be wronged in aught -","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["إِلَّا","مَن","تَابَ","وَءَامَنَ","وَعَمِلَ","صَٰلِحًا","فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","يَدْخُلُونَ","ٱلْجَنَّةَ","وَلَا","يُظْلَمُونَ","شَيْـًٔا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-2-13-8","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"zar vjerujemo?","en":"do we believe?"},{"bs":"vjeruje","en":"he/it believes"},{"bs":"zaista ćete povjerovati","en":"surely you (all) will believe"},{"bs":"pa je povjerovao","en":"so he/it believed"}],"ref":"2:13","answerWord":"أَنُؤْمِنُ","answerSound":"audio/0b6bd2c04d7f06b70001.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when it is said unto them: believe as the people believe, they say: shall we believe as the foolish believe? are not they indeed the foolish? But they know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","قِيلَ","لَهُمْ","ءَامِنُوا۟","كَمَآ","ءَامَنَ","ٱلنَّاسُ","قَالُوٓا۟","أَنُؤْمِنُ","كَمَآ","ءَامَنَ","ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ","أَلَآ","إِنَّهُمْ","هُمُ","ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ","وَلَٰكِن","لَّا","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-2-41-0","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"i vjerujte!","en":"and (you all) believe!"},{"bs":"i neka vjeruju","en":"and let them believe"},{"bs":"pa neka vjeruje","en":"so let him believe"},{"bs":"povjerovali su","en":"they believed"}],"ref":"2:41","answerWord":"وَءَامِنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/44070200ed2cf2e55541.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And believe in that which I reveal, confirming that which ye possess already (of the Scripture), and be not first to disbelieve therein, and part not with My revelations for a trifling price, and keep your duty unto Me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["وَءَامِنُوا۟","بِمَآ","أَنزَلْتُ","مُصَدِّقًا","لِّمَا","مَعَكُمْ","وَلَا","تَكُونُوٓا۟","أَوَّلَ","كَافِرٍۭ","بِهِۦ","وَلَا","تَشْتَرُوا۟","بِـَٔايَٰتِى","ثَمَنًا","قَلِيلًا","وَإِيَّٰىَ","فَٱتَّقُونِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-2-91-8","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"vjerujemo","en":"we believe"},{"bs":"povjerovali ste","en":"you (all) believed"},{"bs":"vjerujte!","en":"(you all) believe!"},{"bs":"i vjeruju","en":"and they believe"}],"ref":"2:91","answerWord":"نُؤْمِنُ","answerSound":"audio/2f32c4b8e03bd274d3ca.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when it is said unto them: Believe in that which Allah hath revealed, they say: We believe in that which was revealed unto us. And they disbelieve in that which cometh after it, though it is the truth confirming that which they possess. Say (unto them, O Muhammad): Why then slew ye the prophets of Allah aforetime, if ye are (indeed) believers?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","قِيلَ","لَهُمْ","ءَامِنُوا۟","بِمَآ","أَنزَلَ","ٱللَّهُ","قَالُوا۟","نُؤْمِنُ","بِمَآ","أُنزِلَ","عَلَيْنَا","وَيَكْفُرُونَ","بِمَا","وَرَآءَهُۥ","وَهُوَ","ٱلْحَقُّ","مُصَدِّقًا","لِّمَا","مَعَهُمْ","قُلْ","فَلِمَ","تَقْتُلُونَ","أَنۢبِيَآءَ","ٱللَّهِ","مِن","قَبْلُ","إِن","كُنتُم","مُّؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-7-101-12","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"da vjeruju","en":"so that they may believe"},{"bs":"zar vjerujemo?","en":"do we believe?"},{"bs":"pa je povjerovala","en":"so she/it believed"},{"bs":"da vjerujete","en":"so that you (all) may believe"}],"ref":"7:101","answerWord":"لِيُؤْمِنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/574fc534ba7fe3a747b7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Such were the townships. We relate some tidings of them unto thee (Muhammad). Their messengers verily came unto them with clear proofs (of Allah's Sovereignty), but they could not believe because they had before denied. Thus doth Allah print upon the hearts of disbelievers (that they hear not).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["تِلْكَ","ٱلْقُرَىٰ","نَقُصُّ","عَلَيْكَ","مِنْ","أَنۢبَآئِهَا","وَلَقَدْ","جَآءَتْهُمْ","رُسُلُهُم","بِٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","فَمَا","كَانُوا۟","لِيُؤْمِنُوا۟","بِمَا","كَذَّبُوا۟","مِن","قَبْلُ","كَذَٰلِكَ","يَطْبَعُ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-10-90-14","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"povjerovao sam","en":"I believed"},{"bs":"i povjerovali ste","en":"and you (all) believed"},{"bs":"povjerovat će","en":"will they believe"},{"bs":"vjerujete","en":"you (all) believe"}],"ref":"10:90","answerWord":"ءَامَنتُ","answerSound":"audio/975d0c749fbfed56b674.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We brought the Children of Israel across the sea, and Pharaoh with his hosts pursued them in rebellion and transgression, till, when the (fate of) drowning overtook him, he exclaimed: I believe that there is no Allah save Him in Whom the Children of Israel believe, and I am of those who surrender (unto Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["وَجَٰوَزْنَا","بِبَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","ٱلْبَحْرَ","فَأَتْبَعَهُمْ","فِرْعَوْنُ","وَجُنُودُهُۥ","بَغْيًا","وَعَدْوًا","حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَآ","أَدْرَكَهُ","ٱلْغَرَقُ","قَالَ","ءَامَنتُ","أَنَّهُۥ","لَآ","إِلَٰهَ","إِلَّا","ٱلَّذِىٓ","ءَامَنَتْ","بِهِۦ","بَنُوٓا۟","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","وَأَنَا۠","مِنَ","ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-3-110-10","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"i vjerujete","en":"and you (all) believe"},{"bs":"da vjeruju","en":"so that they may believe"},{"bs":"povjerovali su","en":"they believed"},{"bs":"zar vjerujemo?","en":"do we believe?"}],"ref":"3:110","answerWord":"وَتُؤْمِنُونَ","answerSound":"audio/3af6c5a9a740bc3a208d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye are the best community that hath been raised up for mankind. Ye enjoin right conduct and forbid indecency; and ye believe in Allah. And if the People of the Scripture had believed it had been better for them. Some of them are believers; but most of them are evil-livers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["كُنتُمْ","خَيْرَ","أُمَّةٍ","أُخْرِجَتْ","لِلنَّاسِ","تَأْمُرُونَ","بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","وَتَنْهَوْنَ","عَنِ","ٱلْمُنكَرِ","وَتُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَلَوْ","ءَامَنَ","أَهْلُ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","لَكَانَ","خَيْرًا","لَّهُم","مِّنْهُمُ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","وَأَكْثَرُهُمُ","ٱلْفَٰسِقُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-5-93-12","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"i povjerovali su","en":"and they believed"},{"bs":"i neka vjeruju","en":"and let them believe"},{"bs":"pa vjerujte","en":"so believe"},{"bs":"vjerujete","en":"you (all) believe"}],"ref":"5:93","answerWord":"وَّءَامَنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/4005e1113331287b8a66.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"There shall be no sin (imputed) unto those who believe and do good works for what they may have eaten (in the past). So be mindful of your duty (to Allah), and believe, and do good works; and again: be mindful of your duty, and believe; and once again: be mindful of your duty, and do right. Allah loveth the good.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["لَيْسَ","عَلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","جُنَاحٌ","فِيمَا","طَعِمُوٓا۟","إِذَا","مَا","ٱتَّقَوا۟","وَّءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","ثُمَّ","ٱتَّقَوا۟","وَّءَامَنُوا۟","ثُمَّ","ٱتَّقَوا۟","وَّأَحْسَنُوا۟","وَٱللَّهُ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[12,17],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"amana-17-94-4","words":["verb:amana"],"options":[{"bs":"vjeruju","en":"they believe"},{"bs":"pa vjerujte","en":"so believe"},{"bs":"i povjerovali su","en":"and they believed"},{"bs":"vjeruje","en":"he/it believes"}],"ref":"17:94","answerWord":"يُؤْمِنُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/446eb22be6d352f5103d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And naught prevented mankind from believing when the guidance came unto them save that they said: Hath Allah sent a mortal as (His) messenger?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati","en":"to believe"},"passage":["وَمَا","مَنَعَ","ٱلنَّاسَ","أَن","يُؤْمِنُوٓا۟","إِذْ","جَآءَهُمُ","ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","إِلَّآ","أَن","قَالُوٓا۟","أَبَعَثَ","ٱللَّهُ","بَشَرًا","رَّسُولًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"آمَنَ"}},{"id":"naha-4-161-3","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranjeni su","en":"they were forbidden"},{"bs":"i zabranjuju","en":"and they forbid"},{"bs":"i zabranjujete","en":"and you (all) forbid"},{"bs":"zabranjujem vam","en":"I forbid you (all)"}],"ref":"4:161","answerWord":"نُهُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/3f570ebd6dd986f52175.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And of their taking usury when they were forbidden it, and of their devouring people's wealth by false pretences, We have prepared for those of them who disbelieve a painful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["وَأَخْذِهِمُ","ٱلرِّبَوٰا۟","وَقَدْ","نُهُوا۟","عَنْهُ","وَأَكْلِهِمْ","أَمْوَٰلَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","بِٱلْبَٰطِلِ","وَأَعْتَدْنَا","لِلْكَٰفِرِينَ","مِنْهُمْ","عَذَابًا","أَلِيمًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-3-104-8","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"i zabranjuju","en":"and they forbid"},{"bs":"i suzdržao je","en":"and restrained"},{"bs":"zabranjujem vam","en":"I forbid you (two)"},{"bs":"i zabranili su","en":"and they forbade"}],"ref":"3:104","answerWord":"وَيَنْهَوْنَ","answerSound":"audio/5c0affe3a218ee1b9866.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And there may spring from you a nation who invite to goodness, and enjoin right conduct and forbid indecency. Such are they who are successful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["وَلْتَكُن","مِّنكُمْ","أُمَّةٌ","يَدْعُونَ","إِلَى","ٱلْخَيْرِ","وَيَأْمُرُونَ","بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","وَيَنْهَوْنَ","عَنِ","ٱلْمُنكَرِ","وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-6-26-1","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranjuju","en":"they forbid"},{"bs":"i zabranili su","en":"and they forbade"},{"bs":"zabranjeno vam je","en":"you (all) are forbidden"},{"bs":"i zabranjuje im","en":"and he/it forbids them"}],"ref":"6:26","answerWord":"يَنْهَوْنَ","answerSound":"audio/eeaf618cb616877d9f50.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they forbid (men) from it and avoid it, and they ruin none save themselves, though they perceive not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["وَهُمْ","يَنْهَوْنَ","عَنْهُ","وَيَنْـَٔوْنَ","عَنْهُ","وَإِن","يُهْلِكُونَ","إِلَّآ","أَنفُسَهُمْ","وَمَا","يَشْعُرُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-6-56-2","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"bilo mi je zabranjeno","en":"I was forbidden"},{"bs":"zabranjujem vam","en":"I forbid you (two)"},{"bs":"i zabranili su","en":"and they forbade"},{"bs":"i zabranjuju","en":"and they forbid"}],"ref":"6:56","answerWord":"نُهِيتُ","answerSound":"audio/3ca8300b17efb9bfd162.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: I am forbidden to worship those on whom ye call instead of Allah. Say: I will not follow your desires, for then should I go astray and I should not be of the rightly guided.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِنِّى","نُهِيتُ","أَنْ","أَعْبُدَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","تَدْعُونَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","قُل","لَّآ","أَتَّبِعُ","أَهْوَآءَكُمْ","قَدْ","ضَلَلْتُ","إِذًا","وَمَآ","أَنَا۠","مِنَ","ٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-60-8-1","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranjuje vam","en":"he/it forbids you (all)"},{"bs":"i zabranjuju","en":"and they forbid"},{"bs":"zabranjeno vam je","en":"you (all) are forbidden"},{"bs":"i zabranjujete","en":"and you (all) forbid"}],"ref":"60:8","answerWord":"يَنْهَىٰكُمُ","answerSound":"audio/e8a5d68723134058f3f8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah forbiddeth you not those who warred not against you on account of religion and drove you not out from your homes, that ye should show them kindness and deal justly with them. Lo! Allah loveth the just dealers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["لَّا","يَنْهَىٰكُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","عَنِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَمْ","يُقَٰتِلُوكُمْ","فِى","ٱلدِّينِ","وَلَمْ","يُخْرِجُوكُم","مِّن","دِيَٰرِكُمْ","أَن","تَبَرُّوهُمْ","وَتُقْسِطُوٓا۟","إِلَيْهِمْ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُقْسِطِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-3-110-7","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"i zabranjujete","en":"and you (all) forbid"},{"bs":"zabranjuje im","en":"he/it forbids them"},{"bs":"i zabrani!","en":"and forbid!"},{"bs":"zabranjuje vam","en":"he/it forbids you (all)"}],"ref":"3:110","answerWord":"وَتَنْهَوْنَ","answerSound":"audio/b4407fb37c5db4ca47e8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye are the best community that hath been raised up for mankind. Ye enjoin right conduct and forbid indecency; and ye believe in Allah. And if the People of the Scripture had believed it had been better for them. Some of them are believers; but most of them are evil-livers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["كُنتُمْ","خَيْرَ","أُمَّةٍ","أُخْرِجَتْ","لِلنَّاسِ","تَأْمُرُونَ","بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","وَتَنْهَوْنَ","عَنِ","ٱلْمُنكَرِ","وَتُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَلَوْ","ءَامَنَ","أَهْلُ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","لَكَانَ","خَيْرًا","لَّهُم","مِّنْهُمُ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","وَأَكْثَرُهُمُ","ٱلْفَٰسِقُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-4-31-4","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranjeno vam je","en":"you (all) are forbidden"},{"bs":"i zabranjuje im","en":"and he/it forbids them"},{"bs":"i zabrani!","en":"and forbid!"},{"bs":"zabranjuje","en":"forbids"}],"ref":"4:31","answerWord":"تُنْهَوْنَ","answerSound":"audio/a355f3a44ac75bade9ee.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If ye avoid the great (things) which ye are forbidden, We will remit from you your evil deeds and make you enter at a noble gate.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["إِن","تَجْتَنِبُوا۟","كَبَآئِرَ","مَا","تُنْهَوْنَ","عَنْهُ","نُكَفِّرْ","عَنكُمْ","سَيِّـَٔاتِكُمْ","وَنُدْخِلْكُم","مُّدْخَلًا","كَرِيمًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-5-63-1","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranjuje im","en":"he/it forbids them"},{"bs":"bilo mi je zabranjeno","en":"I was forbidden"},{"bs":"zabranjeni su","en":"they were forbidden"},{"bs":"zabranjujem vam","en":"I forbid you (all)"}],"ref":"5:63","answerWord":"يَنْهَىٰهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/68390fbe81ddcd11ca58.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Why do not the rabbis and the priests forbid their evil-speaking and their devouring of illicit gain? Verily evil is their handiwork.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["لَوْلَا","يَنْهَىٰهُمُ","ٱلرَّبَّٰنِيُّونَ","وَٱلْأَحْبَارُ","عَن","قَوْلِهِمُ","ٱلْإِثْمَ","وَأَكْلِهِمُ","ٱلسُّحْتَ","لَبِئْسَ","مَا","كَانُوا۟","يَصْنَعُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-7-20-12","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranio vam je","en":"he/it forbade you (two)"},{"bs":"i zabranili su","en":"and they forbade"},{"bs":"zabranjeni su","en":"they were forbidden"},{"bs":"zabranjuje vam","en":"he/it forbids you (all)"}],"ref":"7:20","answerWord":"نَهَىٰكُمَا","answerSound":"audio/173c9ae9135c31c204e6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then Satan whispered to them that he might manifest unto them that which was hidden from them of their shame, and he said: Your Lord forbade you from this tree only lest ye should become angels or become of the immortals.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["فَوَسْوَسَ","لَهُمَا","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنُ","لِيُبْدِىَ","لَهُمَا","مَا","وُۥرِىَ","عَنْهُمَا","مِن","سَوْءَٰتِهِمَا","وَقَالَ","مَا","نَهَىٰكُمَا","رَبُّكُمَا","عَنْ","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلشَّجَرَةِ","إِلَّآ","أَن","تَكُونَا","مَلَكَيْنِ","أَوْ","تَكُونَا","مِنَ","ٱلْخَٰلِدِينَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-7-22-17","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranjujem vam","en":"I forbid you (two)"},{"bs":"zabranjeni su","en":"they were forbidden"},{"bs":"i zabranili su","en":"and they forbade"},{"bs":"zabranjuje","en":"forbids"}],"ref":"7:22","answerWord":"أَنْهَكُمَا","answerSound":"audio/89504aa940db9144f6c4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus did he lead them on with guile. And when they tasted of the tree their shame was manifest to them and they began to hide (by heaping) on themselves some of the leaves of the Garden. And their Lord called them, (saying): Did I not forbid you from that tree and tell you: Lo! Satan is an open enemy to you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["فَدَلَّىٰهُمَا","بِغُرُورٍ","فَلَمَّا","ذَاقَا","ٱلشَّجَرَةَ","بَدَتْ","لَهُمَا","سَوْءَٰتُهُمَا","وَطَفِقَا","يَخْصِفَانِ","عَلَيْهِمَا","مِن","وَرَقِ","ٱلْجَنَّةِ","وَنَادَىٰهُمَا","رَبُّهُمَآ","أَلَمْ","أَنْهَكُمَا","عَن","تِلْكُمَا","ٱلشَّجَرَةِ","وَأَقُل","لَّكُمَآ","إِنَّ","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنَ","لَكُمَا","عَدُوٌّ","مُّبِينٌ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-15-70-2","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranjujemo ti","en":"we forbid you"},{"bs":"zabranio vam je","en":"he/it forbade you (two)"},{"bs":"i zabranjujete","en":"and you (all) forbid"},{"bs":"zabranjuju","en":"they forbid"}],"ref":"15:70","answerWord":"نَنْهَكَ","answerSound":"audio/2cbe167fd6b98896b84e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said; Have we not forbidden you from (entertaining) anyone?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["قَالُوٓا۟","أَوَلَمْ","نَنْهَكَ","عَنِ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-16-90-8","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"i zabranjuje","en":"and he/it forbids"},{"bs":"zabranjujemo ti","en":"we forbid you"},{"bs":"zabranjuje vam","en":"he/it forbids you (all)"},{"bs":"i zabranili su","en":"and they forbade"}],"ref":"16:90","answerWord":"وَيَنْهَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/9dd04814bc2eb1f20073.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Allah enjoineth justice and kindness, and giving to kinsfolk, and forbiddeth lewdness and abomination and wickedness. He exhorteth you in order that ye may take heed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يَأْمُرُ","بِٱلْعَدْلِ","وَٱلْإِحْسَٰنِ","وَإِيتَآئِ","ذِى","ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ","وَيَنْهَىٰ","عَنِ","ٱلْفَحْشَآءِ","وَٱلْمُنكَرِ","وَٱلْبَغْىِ","يَعِظُكُمْ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَذَكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-22-41-11","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"i zabranili su","en":"and they forbade"},{"bs":"zabranio vam je","en":"he/it forbade you (two)"},{"bs":"i zabranjujete","en":"and you (all) forbid"},{"bs":"zabranjuje vam","en":"he/it forbids you (all)"}],"ref":"22:41","answerWord":"وَنَهَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/75ce57b82e5f52cc8adf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who, if We give them power in the land, establish worship and pay the poor-due and enjoin kindness and forbid iniquity. And Allah's is the sequel of events.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","إِن","مَّكَّنَّٰهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","أَقَامُوا۟","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","وَءَاتَوُا۟","ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","وَأَمَرُوا۟","بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","وَنَهَوْا۟","عَنِ","ٱلْمُنكَرِ","وَلِلَّهِ","عَٰقِبَةُ","ٱلْأُمُورِ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-31-17-5","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"i zabrani!","en":"and forbid!"},{"bs":"i zabranili su","en":"and they forbade"},{"bs":"zabranjuje im","en":"he/it forbids them"},{"bs":"i zabranjuje","en":"and he/it forbids"}],"ref":"31:17","answerWord":"وَٱنْهَ","answerSound":"audio/5e04bc1ade3e03a5ee3c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O my dear son! Establish worship and enjoin kindness and forbid iniquity, and persevere whatever may befall thee. Lo! that is of the steadfast heart of things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["يَٰبُنَىَّ","أَقِمِ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","وَأْمُرْ","بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","وَٱنْهَ","عَنِ","ٱلْمُنكَرِ","وَٱصْبِرْ","عَلَىٰ","مَآ","أَصَابَكَ","إِنَّ","ذَٰلِكَ","مِنْ","عَزْمِ","ٱلْأُمُورِ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-79-40-5","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"i suzdržao je","en":"and restrained"},{"bs":"zabranjuju","en":"they forbid"},{"bs":"zabranjeno vam je","en":"you (all) are forbidden"},{"bs":"zabranjuje im","en":"he/it forbids them"}],"ref":"79:40","answerWord":"وَنَهَى","answerSound":"audio/8e1e10b150b142fb1b87.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But as for him who feared to stand before his Lord and restrained his soul from lust,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["وَأَمَّا","مَنْ","خَافَ","مَقَامَ","رَبِّهِۦ","وَنَهَى","ٱلنَّفْسَ","عَنِ","ٱلْهَوَىٰ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"naha-96-9-2","words":["verb:naha"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranjuje","en":"forbids"},{"bs":"i zabranjuje im","en":"and he/it forbids them"},{"bs":"zabranjujem vam","en":"I forbid you (two)"},{"bs":"zabranjujemo ti","en":"we forbid you"}],"ref":"96:9","answerWord":"يَنْهَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/18872a7a3ce349d1d9ab.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Hast thou seen him who dissuadeth","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to prohibit"},"passage":["أَرَءَيْتَ","ٱلَّذِى","يَنْهَىٰ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"نَهَى"}},{"id":"saa-2-2-114-10","words":["verb:saa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"i trudio se","en":"and he/it strove"},{"bs":"trudili su se","en":"they strove"},{"bs":"trude se","en":"they strive"},{"bs":"pa požurite!","en":"so (you all) hasten!"}],"ref":"2:114","answerWord":"وَسَعَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/f16097595bea473b3ec5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And who doth greater wrong than he who forbiddeth the approach to the sanctuaries of Allah lest His name should be mentioned therein, and striveth for their ruin. As for such, it was never meant that they should enter them except in fear. Theirs in the world is ignominy and theirs in the Hereafter is an awful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, žuriti","en":"to strive, to hasten"},"passage":["وَمَنْ","أَظْلَمُ","مِمَّن","مَّنَعَ","مَسَٰجِدَ","ٱللَّهِ","أَن","يُذْكَرَ","فِيهَا","ٱسْمُهُۥ","وَسَعَىٰ","فِى","خَرَابِهَآ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","مَا","كَانَ","لَهُمْ","أَن","يَدْخُلُوهَآ","إِلَّا","خَآئِفِينَ","لَهُمْ","فِى","ٱلدُّنْيَا","خِزْىٌ","وَلَهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","عَذَابٌ","عَظِيمٌ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"سَعَى"}},{"id":"saa-2-22-51-1","words":["verb:saa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"trudili su se","en":"they strove"},{"bs":"i trude se","en":"and they strive"},{"bs":"i trudio se","en":"and he/it strove"},{"bs":"pa požurite!","en":"so (you all) hasten!"}],"ref":"22:51","answerWord":"سَعَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/ecdec8301f1a34967b35.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"While those who strive to thwart Our revelations, such are rightful owners of the Fire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, žuriti","en":"to strive, to hasten"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","سَعَوْا۟","فِىٓ","ءَايَٰتِنَا","مُعَٰجِزِينَ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","أَصْحَٰبُ","ٱلْجَحِيمِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"سَعَى"}},{"id":"saa-2-34-5-1","words":["verb:saa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"trudili su se","en":"they strove"},{"bs":"pa požurite!","en":"so (you all) hasten!"},{"bs":"trude se","en":"they strive"},{"bs":"i trudio se","en":"and he/it strove"}],"ref":"34:5","answerWord":"سَعَوْ","answerSound":"audio/df2e8e2a9a7f166a8b08.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But those who strive against Our revelations, challenging (Us), theirs will be a painful doom of wrath.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, žuriti","en":"to strive, to hasten"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","سَعَوْ","فِىٓ","ءَايَٰتِنَا","مُعَٰجِزِينَ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","لَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","مِّن","رِّجْزٍ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"سَعَى"}},{"id":"saa-2-34-38-1","words":["verb:saa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"trude se","en":"they strive"},{"bs":"i trudio se","en":"and he/it strove"},{"bs":"trudili su se","en":"they strove"},{"bs":"pa požurite!","en":"so (you all) hasten!"}],"ref":"34:38","answerWord":"يَسْعَوْنَ","answerSound":"audio/b91ae9c63e6d41c3a95d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And as for those who strive against Our revelations, challenging, they will be brought to the doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, žuriti","en":"to strive, to hasten"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يَسْعَوْنَ","فِىٓ","ءَايَٰتِنَا","مُعَٰجِزِينَ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","فِى","ٱلْعَذَابِ","مُحْضَرُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"سَعَى"}},{"id":"saa-2-62-9-9","words":["verb:saa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"pa požurite!","en":"so (you all) hasten!"},{"bs":"trudili su se","en":"they strove"},{"bs":"trude se","en":"they strive"},{"bs":"i trudio se","en":"and he/it strove"}],"ref":"62:9","answerWord":"فَٱسْعَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/59e1d2bc3a0c82d3cd71.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! When the call is heard for the prayer of the day of congregation, haste unto remembrance of Allah and leave your trading. That is better for you if ye did but know.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, žuriti","en":"to strive, to hasten"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِذَا","نُودِىَ","لِلصَّلَوٰةِ","مِن","يَوْمِ","ٱلْجُمُعَةِ","فَٱسْعَوْا۟","إِلَىٰ","ذِكْرِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَذَرُوا۟","ٱلْبَيْعَ","ذَٰلِكُمْ","خَيْرٌ","لَّكُمْ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"سَعَى"}},{"id":"ada-36-39-4","words":["verb:ada"],"options":[{"bs":"vratio se","en":"he/it returned"},{"bs":"vraćamo se","en":"we return"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they return"},{"bs":"zaista ćete se vratiti","en":"surely you (all) will return"}],"ref":"36:39","answerWord":"عَادَ","answerSound":"audio/75ffe5be849add47d895.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And for the moon We have appointed mansions till she return like an old shrivelled palm-leaf.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se","en":"to return"},"passage":["وَٱلْقَمَرَ","قَدَّرْنَٰهُ","مَنَازِلَ","حَتَّىٰ","عَادَ","كَٱلْعُرْجُونِ","ٱلْقَدِيمِ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"عادَ"}},{"id":"ada-7-88-14","words":["verb:ada"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista ćete se vratiti","en":"surely you (all) will return"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they return"},{"bs":"vraćamo se","en":"we return"},{"bs":"vratio se","en":"he/it returned"}],"ref":"7:88","answerWord":"لَتَعُودُنَّ","answerSound":"audio/15e292d6ad141964f637.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The chieftains of his people, who were scornful, said: Surely we will drive thee out, O Shu'eyb, and those who believe with thee, from our township, unless ye return to our religion. He said: Even though we hate it?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se","en":"to return"},"passage":["قَالَ","ٱلْمَلَأُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","مِن","قَوْمِهِۦ","لَنُخْرِجَنَّكَ","يَٰشُعَيْبُ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","مَعَكَ","مِن","قَرْيَتِنَآ","أَوْ","لَتَعُودُنَّ","فِى","مِلَّتِنَا","قَالَ","أَوَلَوْ","كُنَّا","كَٰرِهِينَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"عادَ"}},{"id":"ada-58-3-5","words":["verb:ada"],"options":[{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they return"},{"bs":"vraćamo se","en":"we return"},{"bs":"zaista ćete se vratiti","en":"surely you (all) will return"},{"bs":"vratili ste se","en":"you (all) returned"}],"ref":"58:3","answerWord":"يَعُودُونَ","answerSound":"audio/b5c81b6def0d1464f495.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who put away their wives (by saying they are as their mothers) and afterward would go back on that which they have said, (the penalty) in that case (is) the freeing of a slave before they touch one another. Unto this ye are exhorted; and Allah is Informed of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se","en":"to return"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يُظَٰهِرُونَ","مِن","نِّسَآئِهِمْ","ثُمَّ","يَعُودُونَ","لِمَا","قَالُوا۟","فَتَحْرِيرُ","رَقَبَةٍ","مِّن","قَبْلِ","أَن","يَتَمَآسَّا","ذَٰلِكُمْ","تُوعَظُونَ","بِهِۦ","وَٱللَّهُ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ","خَبِيرٌ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"عادَ"}},{"id":"ada-7-29-15","words":["verb:ada"],"options":[{"bs":"vraćate se","en":"you (all) return"},{"bs":"vraćamo se","en":"we return"},{"bs":"vratio se","en":"he/it returned"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they return"}],"ref":"7:29","answerWord":"تَعُودُونَ","answerSound":"audio/63202d517c40dbb1c63d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: My Lord enjoineth justice. And set your faces upright (toward Him) at every place of worship and call upon Him, making religion pure for Him (only). As He brought you into being, so return ye (unto Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se","en":"to return"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَمَرَ","رَبِّى","بِٱلْقِسْطِ","وَأَقِيمُوا۟","وُجُوهَكُمْ","عِندَ","كُلِّ","مَسْجِدٍ","وَٱدْعُوهُ","مُخْلِصِينَ","لَهُ","ٱلدِّينَ","كَمَا","بَدَأَكُمْ","تَعُودُونَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"عادَ"}},{"id":"ada-8-19-12","words":["verb:ada"],"options":[{"bs":"vraćamo se","en":"we return"},{"bs":"zaista ćete se vratiti","en":"surely you (all) will return"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they return"},{"bs":"vratio se","en":"he/it returned"}],"ref":"8:19","answerWord":"نَعُدْ","answerSound":"audio/c503f743ac2a2ba817e5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(O Qureysh!) If ye sought a judgment, now hath the judgment come unto you. And if ye cease (from persecuting the believers) it will be better for you, but if ye return (to the attack) We also shall return. And your host will avail you naught, however numerous it be, and (know) that Allah is with the believers (in His Guidance).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se","en":"to return"},"passage":["إِن","تَسْتَفْتِحُوا۟","فَقَدْ","جَآءَكُمُ","ٱلْفَتْحُ","وَإِن","تَنتَهُوا۟","فَهُوَ","خَيْرٌ","لَّكُمْ","وَإِن","تَعُودُوا۟","نَعُدْ","وَلَن","تُغْنِىَ","عَنكُمْ","فِئَتُكُمْ","شَيْـًٔا","وَلَوْ","كَثُرَتْ","وَأَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","مَعَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"عادَ"}},{"id":"ada-8-38-11","words":["verb:ada"],"options":[{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they return"},{"bs":"vratili ste se","en":"you (all) returned"},{"bs":"vraćate se","en":"you (all) return"},{"bs":"vraćamo se","en":"we return"}],"ref":"8:38","answerWord":"يَعُودُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/4ab6f2c09653cc786e4b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Tell those who disbelieve that if they cease (from persecution of believers) that which is past will be forgiven them; but if they return (thereto) then the example of the men of old hath already gone (before them, for a warning).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se","en":"to return"},"passage":["قُل","لِّلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوٓا۟","إِن","يَنتَهُوا۟","يُغْفَرْ","لَهُم","مَّا","قَدْ","سَلَفَ","وَإِن","يَعُودُوا۟","فَقَدْ","مَضَتْ","سُنَّتُ","ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"عادَ"}},{"id":"ada-17-8-5","words":["verb:ada"],"options":[{"bs":"vratili ste se","en":"you (all) returned"},{"bs":"vraćaju se","en":"they return"},{"bs":"vraćamo se","en":"we return"},{"bs":"vraćate se","en":"you (all) return"}],"ref":"17:8","answerWord":"عُدتُّمْ","answerSound":"audio/fe8c278b9bc0743071dd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It may be that your Lord will have mercy on you, but if ye repeat (the crime) We shall repeat (the punishment), and We have appointed hell a dungeon for the disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vratiti se","en":"to return"},"passage":["عَسَىٰ","رَبُّكُمْ","أَن","يَرْحَمَكُمْ","وَإِنْ","عُدتُّمْ","عُدْنَا","وَجَعَلْنَا","جَهَنَّمَ","لِلْكَٰفِرِينَ","حَصِيرًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"عادَ"}},{"id":"ballagha-7-68-0","words":["verb:ballagha"],"options":[{"bs":"dostavljam vam","en":"I convey to you (all)"},{"bs":"dostavio si","en":"you conveyed"},{"bs":"dostavljaju","en":"they convey"},{"bs":"dostavi!","en":"convey!"}],"ref":"7:68","answerWord":"أُبَلِّغُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/fe324a6ac8f30047d0f9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"I convey unto you the messages of my Lord and am for you a true adviser.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dostaviti, prenijeti (poruku)","en":"to convey, to deliver (a message)"},"passage":["أُبَلِّغُكُمْ","رِسَٰلَٰتِ","رَبِّى","وَأَنَا۠","لَكُمْ","نَاصِحٌ","أَمِينٌ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"بَلَّغَ"}},{"id":"ballagha-5-67-2","words":["verb:ballagha"],"options":[{"bs":"dostavi!","en":"convey!"},{"bs":"dostavljam vam","en":"I convey to you (all)"},{"bs":"dostavio si","en":"you conveyed"},{"bs":"dostavljaju","en":"they convey"}],"ref":"5:67","answerWord":"بَلِّغْ","answerSound":"audio/d244a08fd249045fcc71.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O Messenger! Make known that which hath been revealed unto thee from thy Lord, for if thou do it not, thou wilt not have conveyed His message. Allah will protect thee from mankind. Lo! Allah guideth not the disbelieving folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dostaviti, prenijeti (poruku)","en":"to convey, to deliver (a message)"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلرَّسُولُ","بَلِّغْ","مَآ","أُنزِلَ","إِلَيْكَ","مِن","رَّبِّكَ","وَإِن","لَّمْ","تَفْعَلْ","فَمَا","بَلَّغْتَ","رِسَالَتَهُۥ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَعْصِمُكَ","مِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يَهْدِى","ٱلْقَوْمَ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"بَلَّغَ"}},{"id":"ballagha-5-67-12","words":["verb:ballagha"],"options":[{"bs":"dostavio si","en":"you conveyed"},{"bs":"dostavljam vam","en":"I convey to you (all)"},{"bs":"dostavi!","en":"convey!"},{"bs":"dostavljaju","en":"they convey"}],"ref":"5:67","answerWord":"بَلَّغْتَ","answerSound":"audio/ccac85e89a09df3fde8c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O Messenger! Make known that which hath been revealed unto thee from thy Lord, for if thou do it not, thou wilt not have conveyed His message. Allah will protect thee from mankind. Lo! Allah guideth not the disbelieving folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dostaviti, prenijeti (poruku)","en":"to convey, to deliver (a message)"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلرَّسُولُ","بَلِّغْ","مَآ","أُنزِلَ","إِلَيْكَ","مِن","رَّبِّكَ","وَإِن","لَّمْ","تَفْعَلْ","فَمَا","بَلَّغْتَ","رِسَالَتَهُۥ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَعْصِمُكَ","مِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يَهْدِى","ٱلْقَوْمَ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"بَلَّغَ"}},{"id":"ballagha-33-39-1","words":["verb:ballagha"],"options":[{"bs":"dostavljaju","en":"they convey"},{"bs":"dostavi!","en":"convey!"},{"bs":"dostavljam vam","en":"I convey to you (all)"},{"bs":"dostavio si","en":"you conveyed"}],"ref":"33:39","answerWord":"يُبَلِّغُونَ","answerSound":"audio/38a7bf78433cb94e452f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who delivered the messages of Allah and feared Him, and feared none save Allah. Allah keepeth good account.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dostaviti, prenijeti (poruku)","en":"to convey, to deliver (a message)"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يُبَلِّغُونَ","رِسَٰلَٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَيَخْشَوْنَهُۥ","وَلَا","يَخْشَوْنَ","أَحَدًا","إِلَّا","ٱللَّهَ","وَكَفَىٰ","بِٱللَّهِ","حَسِيبًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"بَلَّغَ"}},{"id":"ballagha-46-23-5","words":["verb:ballagha"],"options":[{"bs":"i dostavljam vam","en":"and I convey to you (all)"},{"bs":"dostavio si","en":"you conveyed"},{"bs":"dostavi!","en":"convey!"},{"bs":"dostavljaju","en":"they convey"}],"ref":"46:23","answerWord":"وَأُبَلِّغُكُم","answerSound":"audio/c76f002766cc0ae216fd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: The knowledge is with Allah only. I convey unto you that wherewith I have been sent, but I see you are a folk that know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dostaviti, prenijeti (poruku)","en":"to convey, to deliver (a message)"},"passage":["قَالَ","إِنَّمَا","ٱلْعِلْمُ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَأُبَلِّغُكُم","مَّآ","أُرْسِلْتُ","بِهِۦ","وَلَٰكِنِّىٓ","أَرَىٰكُمْ","قَوْمًا","تَجْهَلُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"بَلَّغَ"}},{"id":"thaqifa-2-191-2","words":["verb:thaqifa"],"options":[{"bs":"zatekli ste ih","en":"you (all) came upon them"},{"bs":"svladaju vas","en":"they overpower you (all)"},{"bs":"zatečeni su","en":"they were found"},{"bs":"zatekneš ih","en":"you come upon them"}],"ref":"2:191","answerWord":"ثَقِفْتُمُوهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/e0e255c94bdc5c5f0436.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And slay them wherever ye find them, and drive them out of the places whence they drove you out, for persecution is worse than slaughter. And fight not with them at the Inviolable Place of Worship until they first attack you there, but if they attack you (there) then slay them. Such is the reward of disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zateći, naići na; brzo shvatiti","en":"to come upon, to find; to grasp"},"passage":["وَٱقْتُلُوهُمْ","حَيْثُ","ثَقِفْتُمُوهُمْ","وَأَخْرِجُوهُم","مِّنْ","حَيْثُ","أَخْرَجُوكُمْ","وَٱلْفِتْنَةُ","أَشَدُّ","مِنَ","ٱلْقَتْلِ","وَلَا","تُقَٰتِلُوهُمْ","عِندَ","ٱلْمَسْجِدِ","ٱلْحَرَامِ","حَتَّىٰ","يُقَٰتِلُوكُمْ","فِيهِ","فَإِن","قَٰتَلُوكُمْ","فَٱقْتُلُوهُمْ","كَذَٰلِكَ","جَزَآءُ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"ثَقِفَ"}},{"id":"thaqifa-60-2-1","words":["verb:thaqifa"],"options":[{"bs":"svladaju vas","en":"they overpower you (all)"},{"bs":"zatekneš ih","en":"you come upon them"},{"bs":"zatekli ste ih","en":"you (all) came upon them"},{"bs":"zatečeni su","en":"they were found"}],"ref":"60:2","answerWord":"يَثْقَفُوكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/fe09352bb68f1fe98838.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If they have the upper hand of you, they will be your foes, and will stretch out their hands and their tongues toward you with evil (intent), and they long for you to disbelieve.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zateći, naići na; brzo shvatiti","en":"to come upon, to find; to grasp"},"passage":["إِن","يَثْقَفُوكُمْ","يَكُونُوا۟","لَكُمْ","أَعْدَآءً","وَيَبْسُطُوٓا۟","إِلَيْكُمْ","أَيْدِيَهُمْ","وَأَلْسِنَتَهُم","بِٱلسُّوٓءِ","وَوَدُّوا۟","لَوْ","تَكْفُرُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"ثَقِفَ"}}]